**`Array.prototype.shuffleInPlace()` is not a native JavaScript method.** There is no built-in shuffle function in the standard JavaScript Array prototype.

## Why It Doesn't Exist

JavaScript's standard library doesn't include a shuffle method because:
- Shuffling algorithms have different use cases and performance characteristics
